MI50 ROCm 10.x compatibility fork

This repository contains original build, packaging, policy and validation
material together with patches intended for third-party ROCm/TheRock,
PyTorch and llama.cpp sources. Those third-party sources and patches retain
their respective upstream copyrights and licenses; this repository does not
relicense them. Review the applicable upstream license before redistributing
any generated source tree, binary package or firmware.

This is an unofficial community project and is not affiliated with or
endorsed by AMD.
